    "limitations": "Cowork can append authorized intents, record completion in native intent and Worker-session history, prove goals from existing task-local evidence after explicit confirmation, pause ARTEx execution on direct operator request, update a task-owned finding status after exact operator confirmation, record evidence-backed retests, decide task-owned pending intercepts after explicit operator decisions, change task-owned intercept rules after exact operation confirmation, and send budgeted target requests from the Cowork session after exact per-run authorization. When record_traffic=yes is explicitly bound into that authorization, completed exchanges are persisted in ARTEx native Traffic and a task activity event; otherwise no native Traffic capture occurs. These requests do not enqueue ARTEx workers. Native ARTEx background task execution remains unavailable through Cowork subscription; resuming ARTEx invokes its separate LLM runtime."
